<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka John Keells 3-mth net up 170 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka John Keells 3-mth net up 170 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for three months ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			     1997		  1996</p>
<p>     Net profit	  130.42   vs	 47.59</p>
<p>     Turnover	  1,522.43   vs    1,334.11</p>
<p>     Tax		    69.40   vs	 46.12</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. John Keells Holdings is one of three blue chip conglomerates listed in Colombo. The company consolidates accounts of over 61 companies, 14 of which are listed.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
